<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46201" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεφύ̆ρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		sts. also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφυρίη</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the West</i> or <i>west wind,
			westerly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.3.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ζ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέμοις</span>) <i>at the period of
			westwinds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				618a7
			</span></i>; <i>western</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					290.166
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).126
			</span></i> (Paros, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠὸν ζ</span>. <i>wind</i>-egg, also
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμιαῖον, ὑπηνέμιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				560a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				749b1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζ. ἄκρα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφύριον, τό</span>, name of a
			cape in Cyprus, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.6.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.318d
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφύριον, τό</span>, cape in <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> Italy, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
